          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UInputBehavior*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "When this function returns true, this behavior will always receive ForceEndCapture calls even when it is not actively\ncapturing. This is useful for behaviors that do not capture, but hold state (ex. Key Modifiers) and want to be notified when to clear that state."
